She thought: "If I just touch the hem of his garment, I will be healed."
Jesus saw her and melted. "Oh, gazelle woman, don't lose hope," he said. "Your faith has healed you." At that moment, the woman was healed.
When Jesus entered the governor's house, he saw there the flute players. And he saw the noisy crowd.
